{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "bdf361b3-351c-8f73-a9c7-0b0f1fee4737",
  "created_at": "2026-02-23T11:50:59-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Lucia Silva",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Denise Arruda",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T11:46:20-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Denise. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T11:46:25-05:00",
      "duration": 20,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hi, yeah, hi. Um, I'm calling about water in my cellar. It came in after the nor'easter, last weekend, Saturday into Sunday. And I'm kind of fed up, honestly, because I've been in this house a few years and it has never done that."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T11:46:45-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Oh no. Okay, how much water are we talking about?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T11:46:50-05:00",
      "duration": 19,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "A few inches. It seeped in along the back wall, and I had to spend all of Sunday night with a wet vac. Like, wicked annoying. I don't get why it happened now, so I walked around the block this morning to look."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T11:47:09-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "And what did you see?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T11:47:12-05:00",
      "duration": 26,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "So the storm drain out front was backed up, there was still standing water around it Sunday. And there's a manhole cover right near it that looks off by an inch, like it's sitting crooked or raised up. Somebody's going to catch a tire on it. I'm pretty sure that's part of why the water didn't go anywhere."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T11:47:38-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. What's the address, hon?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T11:47:41-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "147 Coggeshall Avenue, up on the Hill. The drain is right in front of the house, kind of by the corner."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T11:47:51-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it, 147 Coggeshall. Let me write that down. Is the water still sitting there today?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T11:47:59-05:00",
      "duration": 22,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Mostly gone today, but there's a ton of leaves and gunk packed into the grate. [pause] Can I ask something? Is that a city drain or a state one? Because somebody told me some of the roads around here are the state's and I don't want to be bounced around."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T11:48:21-05:00",
      "duration": 19,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good question. Coggeshall is a city street, so the drain on it would be ours. The manhole, I'd want the crew to look at it either way, and if it turns out to belong to a utility they'll sort out who to send."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T11:48:40-05:00",
      "duration": 18,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, that's good, because honestly I've been stressing that nobody was gonna own it. And, like, I get that everybody got hit this weekend, but if the drain's clogged and it sends water into my cellar, that's on somebody."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T11:48:58-05:00",
      "duration": 20,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Understood. I'll put in a work order for the drain clearing and flag the manhole cover as a separate item so it doesn't get lost. Crews are working through a long list after a storm like that, so it may be a few days."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T11:49:18-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "A few days, okay. Um, and if it rains again before then?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T11:49:24-05:00",
      "duration": 18,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "If it's heavy and the drain is blocked again, call right back and tell them there's already a ticket. That moves it up. Can I get a callback number in case the crew needs to reach you at the house?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T11:49:42-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure, it's 401-555-0158."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T11:49:44-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Zero one five eight. And your name?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T11:49:48-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Lucia Silva. S-I-L-V-A."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T11:49:50-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thanks, Lucia. Anything else you noticed out there? Cracks in the road, anything like that?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T11:49:57-05:00",
      "duration": 19,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Nah, just the cover and the grate. Oh, and random, but I parallel parked on Broadway this morning to walk over and look, first try, tight spot and everything. I was kinda proud of myself. Small win, since the weekend was a disaster."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T11:50:16-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "[pause] Hey, take the wins. Parking on Broadway is no joke."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T11:50:22-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Right? Anyway. So the drain gets cleared, and somebody looks at the manhole."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T11:50:29-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's it. Two items under 147 Coggeshall Avenue. If you don't see anyone by the end of the week, call and ask for me or whoever's here, and mention the drain."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T11:50:43-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Thank you. I just really don't want to be vacuuming my cellar again."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T11:50:50-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I hear you. Hope the rest of your day is drier. Bye now."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T11:50:57-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You too. Bye."
    }
  ],
